-- Scaled by 10⁴: 343 × 87 = 29,841 ≤ 29,970 (confirming ratio > 870,000×).
ec-light-beats-sound-ratio : leb (times 343 87) 29970 ≡ true
ec-light-beats-sound-ratio = λ i → true
